.TH CHM-UTF8 1 "2026-09-23" "Chimera II OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chm-utf8 \- UTF-8, Unicode and emoji diagnostics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-utf8
check|count|sanitize|emoji|aliases TEXT
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates UTF-8, counts Unicode code points, sanitizes text, detects emoji and expands Chimera emoji aliases such as :rocket:.
